  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has supported the AIDS and Rights Alliance for Southern Africa, ARASA, since 2004. The project today got 12-14 different donors. The organisation has been evaluated by external consultants and one of the results and recommendations was the set up of a basket fund mechanism and the development of a Strategic Plan for the nextcoming period. A bridging fund is need to get donors together in basket fund</narrative>
